{'symbol': 'MU', 'date': '2022-04-04 16:59:00', 'title': 'MICRON APPOINTS FRAN DILLARD AS VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF DIVERSITY INCLUSION OFFICER', 'text': "BOISE, IDAHO, APRIL 04, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- MICRON TECHNOLOGY, INC. (NASDAQ: MU), AN INDUSTRY LEADER IN INNOVATIVE MEMORY AND STORAGE SOLUTIONS, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE APPOINTMENT OF FRAN DILLARD TO THE ROLE OF VICE PRESIDENT AND CHIEF DIVERSITY INCLUSION OFFICER. DILLARD BRINGS MORE THAN 20 YEARS OF DIVERSITY LEADERSHIP AND HR EXPERIENCE TO ADVANCE THE COMPANY'S KEY DIVERSITY INITIATIVES.\u202f\u202f"}